ed by the context, as the context only mentions the job-creation program and its failure.\n   - **Option B**: "The unemployment rate is higher now than at any time before the inception of the job-creation program." This option suggests that the legislator assumes that the unemployment rate was lower before the job-creation program started. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
