ogether.\n     - Therefore, this option is not possible.\n   - **Option C: Peng Youwen and He Zhilian**.\n     - If Peng Youwen is selected, Song Wenkai cannot be selected because they cannot be together.\n     - Therefore, this option is not possible.\n   - **Option D: Fang Rufen and He Zhilian**.\n     - If Fang Rufen is selected, Guo Yanran cannot be selected because they cannot be together.\n     - Therefore, this option is not possible.\n\n5. **Conclusion:**.\n   - After analyzing all the options, we find that none of them are consistent with the constraints when Tang Xiaohua is selected.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
