on**: This option seems to focus more on general health preservation rather than specifically addressing the relationship between weather and cardiovascular diseases.\n   - **B) Why did the name Indian summer come**: This option is unrelated to the content of the paragraph, which discusses the effects of hot and sultry weather on cardiovascular health.\n   - **C) Cause of cardiovascular and cerebrovascular diseases**: This option directly addresses the main topic of the paragraph, which discusses the relationship between hot and sultry weather and cardiovascular diseases.\n   - **D) Prevent myocardial infarction at the turn of summer and autumn**: This option also focuses on preventing myocardial infarction, which is a specific concern mentioned in the paragraph.\n\n3. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
