fic to Nobel Prize winners.\n   - **Option B**: "Nobel prize winners have the ability to make creative thinking through image thinking.".\n     - This option directly relates to the context, which states that image thinking helps make major scientific breakthroughs. It is a logical assumption based on the given information.\n   - **Option C**: "Nobel prize winners have made major scientific breakthroughs.".\n     - While this option is true, it is not an assumption but rather a fact. It does not follow logically from the context about Nobel Prize winners using image thinking.\n   - **Option D**: "Nobel prize winners are smarter and work harder than ordinary scientists.".\n     - This option is not directly supported by the context. It is a general statement about Nobel Prize winners, but it is not a logical assumption based on the given information.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct assumption is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
