ly burned the letter out of anger or frustration.\n\nC) Mr. Gao accidentally threw a cigarette butt on the sofa and caused a fire. This act does not meet the criteria for arson because Mr. Gao did not set fire intentionally. He was simply careless and did not intend to cause a fire.\n\nD) Feeling unbearable in this situation, Mr. Bao was filled with gasoline and set fire to himself in the downtown area. This act does not meet the criteria for arson because Mr. Bao set fire to himself intentionally, but the act itself is not considered arson. Arson requires setting fire on purpose to cause harm or damage, not self-harm.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
