i were rated as outstanding graduates." This option directly contradicts the party secretary\'s disagreement because it implies that both \\( L \\) and \\( W \\) are true, which would mean the class leader\'s statement is true, contradicting the party secretary\'s disagreement. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
