 the current tax system in Carina requires, would provide insight into the cost of implementing the AMT plan. However, this option does not directly address the impact on the city's revenue.\n\nOption B, the dollar value of the tax exemptions the top 10% of wage earners in Carina currently take, would provide information about the current tax system and the exemptions available to high-income individuals. However, this option does not directly address the impact of the AMT plan on the city's revenue.\n\nOption C, the average dollar value of Carina citizens' tax payments for the previous year, would provide information about the current tax system and the revenue generated by the city. However, this option does not directly address the impact of the AMT plan on the city's revenue. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
