messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nPeople may be divided into two classes: those who are a little ambitious and those who are not. For ordinary people, a little ambition is a firm motivation to pull them out of their ordinary lives. Without that ambition, can only be powerless and even ignorant, slowly submerged by the ordinary life. In times of change, that bit of ambition can lead to spectacular results.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following statements constitutes a rebuttal to the above statement?\n# Options:\nA) Liu bei, who made straw sandals, never forgot that he was the emperor's uncle.because of this, he went from empty-handed to one-third of the world.\nB) Although zhang xiong had high ambitions, he was mediocre in intelligence. he worked hard all his life, but nothing was accomplished, and he was bruised and bruised all over.\nC) Liu qin has neither ambition nor special talent, just by virtue of her natural beauty and the help of noble people in her life, she has accomplished many things.\nD) The chrysanthemum elder sister is neither talented nor beautiful, but she thinks highly of herself, constantly toss about, life also lead a prosperous life.", "<think>.\nTo determine which option constitutes a rebuttal to the given statement, we need to analyze each option based on the context provided. The context emphasizes the importance of a little ambition for ordinary people to achieve significant results during times of change. Let's evaluate each option:.\n\nA) Liu Bei's story demonstrates how a little ambition can lead to spectacular results. This option aligns with the context, as Liu Bei's ambition helped him rise from humble beginnings to become one-third of the world.\n\nB) Zhang Xiong's story shows that high ambition does not necessarily lead to success. His mediocrity in intelligence and hard work resulted in no accomplishments. This option contradicts the context, as it suggests that ambition alone is not enough for success.\n\nC) Liu Qin's story illustrates how natural beauty and the help of noble people can lead to success without ambition. This option does not directly address the importance of ambition, so it does not constitute a rebuttal.\n\nD) The chrysanthemum elder sister's story highlights the importance of thinking highly of oneself and constantly tossing about. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
