sed on its main components. It only provides a criterion for determining unnaturalness but does not provide a clear justification for why nylon should be considered natural or not.\n\nC) A substance is no more natural than its least natural component.\nThis option suggests that a substance is considered natural only if it is no more natural than its least natural component. However, this option does not provide a clear justification for why nylon should be considered natural or not based on its main components. It only provides a criterion for determining naturalness but does not provide a clear justification for why nylon should be considered natural or not.\n\nD) A substance is no less natural than the processes used in its production.\nThis option suggests that a substance is considered natural only if it is no less natural than the processes used in its production. This option directly addresses the issue of whether nylon is natural or not based on its main components. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
